  "note": "Swedish political parties for Meta Ad Library ingestion. `match` = page-name regex (party org pages: national, regional, municipal). `youthMatch` = youth-league pages, tested first. `search` = ads_archive search_terms used to discover pages. `national` = exact page names treated as the national org. Pages that are not party orgs (politicians, party leaders, campaign pages) are kept as `affiliate` when they run declared political/issue ads that surfaced under a party's search term.",
